1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,231
Part (b): name two input devices for checking product codes in the warehouse, each with one advantage.

2
00:00:07,231 --> 00:00:11,910
Example: barcode or Q R scanner — fast input, fewer keying errors.

3
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:16,518
Or: handheld data terminal — check beside the shelf in real time.

4
00:00:16,518 --> 00:00:19,637
Or: R F I D reader — read many tags at once.

5
00:00:19,637 --> 00:00:24,600
Remember: device plus advantage; do not treat output devices as input.

